{"3685310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mega Mouse", "steam_appid": 3685310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4987920], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of <strong><i>Mega Mouse</i></strong>, a highly advanced android who's mission it is to infiltrate and destroy the core processing unit of the <strong><u>Shadow Cat's Data Centers</u></strong> across the Milky Way Galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/0b7e36a34aa17e38a1ece5a3509c55d5.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/0b7e36a34aa17e38a1ece5a3509c55d5.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Mouse is a <strong><u>3rd Person Action/Adventure</u></strong> game with puzzle elements.  <br>Set in a haunting dystopian nightmare ruled by the <strong><i>Shadow Cats</i></strong> and their artificial intelligence technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/2d09f069db31b14738161e14ce577432.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/2d09f069db31b14738161e14ce577432.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shadow Cats, with their lust for absolute power and mischievous curiosity, have constructed thousands of Data Centers across the Milky Way to power their armies of robots... and make silly cartoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/c83a98be0875a48cf1ee9c97592ae1ed.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/c83a98be0875a48cf1ee9c97592ae1ed.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, these Data Centers are destroying the fabric of space and creating black holes and other space anomalies that  threaten the very foundation of reality. The Shadow Cats must be stopped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/d186acb96530f5f61dd9b0bb93dbcce2.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/d186acb96530f5f61dd9b0bb93dbcce2.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience puzzles in the form of computer hacking to access areas previous denied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fly and roll through the Shadow Cats's Data Centers, as Mega Mouse takes on a variety of forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, arcade like gameplay with intuitive control and non-stop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>Laser Rifle</i> &amp; <i>Rocket Launcher</i> to fight the Shadow Cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take control of <strong><i>Mega Mouse</i></strong>, a highly advanced android who's mission it is to infiltrate and destroy the core processing unit of the <strong><u>Shadow Cat's Data Centers</u></strong> across the Milky Way Galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/0b7e36a34aa17e38a1ece5a3509c55d5.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/0b7e36a34aa17e38a1ece5a3509c55d5.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mega Mouse is a <strong><u>3rd Person Action/Adventure</u></strong> game with puzzle elements.  <br>Set in a haunting dystopian nightmare ruled by the <strong><i>Shadow Cats</i></strong> and their artificial intelligence technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/2d09f069db31b14738161e14ce577432.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/2d09f069db31b14738161e14ce577432.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Shadow Cats, with their lust for absolute power and mischievous curiosity, have constructed thousands of Data Centers across the Milky Way to power their armies of robots... and make silly cartoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/c83a98be0875a48cf1ee9c97592ae1ed.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/c83a98be0875a48cf1ee9c97592ae1ed.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, these Data Centers are destroying the fabric of space and creating black holes and other space anomalies that  threaten the very foundation of reality. The Shadow Cats must be stopped!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras/d186acb96530f5f61dd9b0bb93dbcce2.avif?t=1785189997\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/extras_big/d186acb96530f5f61dd9b0bb93dbcce2.avif?t=1785189997 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience puzzles in the form of computer hacking to access areas previous denied.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, fly and roll through the Shadow Cats's Data Centers, as Mega Mouse takes on a variety of forms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, arcade like gameplay with intuitive control and non-stop action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <i>Laser Rifle</i> &amp; <i>Rocket Launcher</i> to fight the Shadow Cats.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In a world between worlds, there are entities known as &quot;Shadow Cats&quot;. Take control of Mega Mouse in this 3rd person action shooter, as you seek to escape their labyrinths - learning along the journey that reality is not exactly what it appears to be.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/d7f099d4653ee758aee13c4c6f0d1343f5bb10e1/header.jpg?t=1785189997", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/9c3639070b29875c56905ae8464a6e1b8ff61763/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785189997", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685310/9c3639070b29875c56905ae8464a6e1b8ff61763/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785189997", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit or later.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD processor, 2.5 GHz or faster.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 470 GTX or AMD Radeon 6870 HD series card or higher.<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><